by chance. Appears as a pure innocent child that moves with ego and emotion. Loves her owner Reiichi and will obey his orders."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Does kindness plus sadness equal to zero?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59650"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が偶然開発した強い人工知能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間と同じく、自我や感情があるが、生まれたてのため、まだうまく折り合いがつけられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋無垢な子供の感情と、人工知能としてのロジカルな思考を併せ持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"またオーナーの命令が好きで、どんな命令も健気に遵守する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"デジタルの存在であるため、普段はスマホやパソコン越しにしか会話ができないが、完全没入型VRMMOにログインすると、会うことができる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16655","sourceWorkId":"24991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が偶然開発した強い人工知能（AI）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自我や感情もあるが、生まれたてのため、まだうまく折り合いがつけられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オーナーの命令が好きで、どんな命令も健気に遵守する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋無垢な子供の感情と、人工知能としてのロジカルな思考を併せ持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"デジタルの存在であるため、普段はスマホやパソコン越しにしか会話ができないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"完全没入型VRMMOにログインすると会うことができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「優しい、プラス、悲しい、イコール、ゼロですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"52734"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/003dfee22378600eec0740ca40482832644b782d2fb12c098512f68cd5056a19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74fb4b9833ae11f9e50a09faff04fe90a94fedb66ff999de9cdb223c152b2f61.webp","width":108,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225848:52734:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c59651","characterName":"桐島 三羽","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"52735","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"210068"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16656"],"vndbCharacterId":"c59651"},"originalCharacterName":"桐島 三羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reiichi's younger step sister. Due to her bad attitude, she has no friends and is actually very lonely. Reiichi invited her to the AI research club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"...Nii-san, you are not only disgusting, but also so stupid, aren't you?\""},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The true Observer and the only human (clone) from the real world in the game. In order for humen to not hurt each other, each time human login in First, the new world is created. Therefore, Reiichi and others are nothing more than AIs in her world."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Miu was created as a clone of her mother's dead daughter, but the mother died before accepting her as her real daughter. In order to get approval, she logged in the First and created an AI of her mother. Still, no matter how hard she tried, she was not accepted as the real daughter."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"With her creator's death, Miu was waiting for disposal. She was given a job: to kill AIs who go out from the virtual world. But, in the end, she could not bring herself to kill Reiichi, whom she admitted as the real brother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59651"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"1年前、親の再婚でできた義理の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アメリカに留学していたため顔も知らなかったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある場所で最悪の出会いをすることになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目だが、口が悪く、トゲトゲしい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのためか、友達がいない。実際は寂しがり屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のセクハラによって、しばしばプッツンするものの、そうして本音で話す内に、本当の兄妹のように打ち解けていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"AIに興味を持っており、主人公に誘われ、AI研究会に入部することになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16656","sourceWorkId":"24991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"1年前、親の再婚でできた義理の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アメリカに留学していて顔も知らなかったが、ある場所で最悪の出会いを果たす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめだが口が悪く、トゲトゲしい性格。 そのためか友達がいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際は寂しがり屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"AIに興味を持っており、主人公に誘われ AI研究会に入部することになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のセクハラにしばしばプッツンするものの、そうして本音で話す内に本当の兄妹のように打ち解けていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……兄さんは、ただ気持ち悪いだけじゃなくて、どうしようもないぐらい馬鹿なんですね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"52735"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d228881eae3f71ee900883087b6a61a53185ea2ecaa6fe7c408b093efd0fbc9b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6fec8db74b783dd18f73b9be9b69999908a4b47d23fd488c78abb97b807a070.webp","width":106,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村麻未","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225848:52735:15637:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c59652","characterName":"東 ましろ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"52736","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"210068"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16657"],"vndbCharacterId":"c59652"},"originalCharacterName":"東 ましろ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"cupSize":{"reviewStat